deepin-meme-plugin (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of deepin-meme-plugin
  * Control center plugin for interactive dynamic wallpaper effects
  * Desktop effect daemon with file operation monitoring
  * DConfig schema for persistent settings
  * 6 built-in theme packages: example, scifi-hero, pixel-monster, cosmic, fireworks, ninja
  * Each theme includes wallpaper video + 5 effect videos (delete/create/rename/move/copy) + sound effects
  * Dynamic wallpaper setting via Wayland D-Bus + X11 fallback window
  * D-Bus interface: SetEnabled/SetTheme/GetThemes/PreviewEffect/ReloadThemes
  * systemd user service + autostart desktop entry
  * Theme development guide for extending new animations and effects
  * Supports X11 and Wayland sessions

 -- liujianqiang <liujianqiang@uniontech.com>  Thu, 14 Aug 2026 19:00:00 +0800
